    "patch": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Strict//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-strict.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"en-US\" lang=\"en-US\">\n<!-- git web interface version 2.26.2, (C) 2005-2006, Kay Sievers <kay.sievers@vrfy.org>, Christian Gierke -->\n<!-- git core binaries version 2.43.7 -->\n<head>\n<meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"/>\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"gitweb/2.26.2 git/2.43.7\"/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, nofollow\"/>\n<title>sourceware.org Git - elfutils.git/commitdiff</title>\n<base href=\"https://sourceware.org/git\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"static/gitweb.css\"/>\n<link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"elfutils.git - log - RSS feed\" href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=rss\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"elfutils.git - log - RSS feed (no merges)\" href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=rss;opt=--no-merges\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"elfutils.git - log - Atom feed\" href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=atom\" type=\"application/atom+xml\" />\n<link rel=\"alternate\" title=\"elfutils.git - log - Atom feed (no merges)\" href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=atom;opt=--no-merges\" type=\"application/atom+xml\" />\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"static/git-favicon.png\" type=\"image/png\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page_header\">\n<a href=\"http://git-scm.com/\" title=\"git homepage\"><img alt=\"git\" class=\"logo\" height=\"27\" src=\"static/git-logo.png\" width=\"72\" /></a><a href=\"/git\">projects</a> / <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=summary\">elfutils.git</a> / commitdiff\n</div>\n<div class=\"page_nav\">\n<a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=summary\">summary</a> | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=shortlog;h=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">shortlog</a> | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=log;h=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">log</a> | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=commit;h=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">commit</a> | commitdiff | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=tree;h=1ed73124e8513b6afac3457b0a5ad7e5165e229b;hb=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">tree</a><br/>\n<a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=commitdiff_plain;h=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">raw</a> | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=patch;h=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">patch</a> | inline | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=commitdiff;h=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71;ds=sidebyside\">side by side</a> (parent: <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=commitdiff;h=1b09e67353f46f2ff9039da78a37d7717155df08\">1b09e67</a>)<br/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"header\">\n<a class=\"title\" href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=commit;h=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">libelf: Make sure ar_size starts with a digit before calling atol.</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"title_text\">\n<table class=\"object_header\">\n<tr><td>author</td><td>Mark Wielaard &lt;mark@klomp.org&gt;</td><td rowspan=\"2\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td><span class=\"datetime\">Thu, 17 Mar 2022 13:03:06 +0000</span> (14:03 +0100)</td></tr>\n<tr><td>committer</td><td>Mark Wielaard &lt;mark@klomp.org&gt;</td><td rowspan=\"2\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td><span class=\"datetime\">Thu, 17 Mar 2022 23:54:55 +0000</span> (<span class=\"atnight\">00:54</span> +0100)</td></tr>\n</table></div>\n<div class=\"page_body\">\n<div class=\"log\">\nThe&nbsp;ar_size&nbsp;field&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;10&nbsp;character&nbsp;string,&nbsp;not&nbsp;zero&nbsp;terminated,&nbsp;of<br/>\ndecimal&nbsp;digits&nbsp;right&nbsp;padded&nbsp;with&nbsp;spaces.&nbsp;&nbsp;Make&nbsp;sure&nbsp;it&nbsp;actually&nbsp;starts<br/>\nwith&nbsp;a&nbsp;digit&nbsp;before&nbsp;calling&nbsp;atol&nbsp;on&nbsp;it.&nbsp;&nbsp;We&nbsp;already&nbsp;make&nbsp;sure&nbsp;it&nbsp;is<br/>\nzero&nbsp;terminated.&nbsp;Otherwise&nbsp;atol&nbsp;might&nbsp;produce&nbsp;unexpected&nbsp;results.<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"signoff\">Signed-off-by: Mark Wielaard &lt;mark@klomp.org&gt;</span><br/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"list_head\">\n</div>\n<table class=\"diff_tree\">\n<tr class=\"dark\">\n<td><a class=\"list\" href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=blob;f=libelf/ChangeLog;h=07dd905f96e99686a29c766e2cb82b785d694494;hb=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">libelf/ChangeLog</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td class=\"link\"><a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=commitdiff;h=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71#patch1\">patch</a> | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=blob;f=libelf/ChangeLog;h=07dd905f96e99686a29c766e2cb82b785d694494;hb=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">blob</a> | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=history;f=libelf/ChangeLog;hb=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">history</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"light\">\n<td><a class=\"list\" href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=blob;f=libelf/elf_begin.c;h=17d9b1f3cc46e6b2b775520484ebd6775b7cd2e3;hb=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">libelf/elf_begin.c</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td class=\"link\"><a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=commitdiff;h=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71#patch2\">patch</a> | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=blob;f=libelf/elf_begin.c;h=17d9b1f3cc46e6b2b775520484ebd6775b7cd2e3;hb=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">blob</a> | <a href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=history;f=libelf/elf_begin.c;hb=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">history</a></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"patchset\">\n<div class=\"patch\" id=\"patch1\">\n<div class=\"diff header\">diff --git <a class=\"path\" href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=blob;f=libelf/ChangeLog;h=1883af0725dd15deab55c9eb2f18434773a2c77f\">a/libelf/ChangeLog</a> <a class=\"path\" href=\"/git?p=elfutils.git;a=blob;f=libelf/ChangeLog;h=07dd905f96e99686a29c766e2cb82b785d694494;hb=ed42e7cf11ddb11ffcce9e17276476e0c3d14c71\">b/libelf/ChangeLog</a></div>\n<div class=\"diff extended_header\">\nindex 1883af0725dd15deab55c9eb2f18434773a2c77f..